                  {
                    "fillColor": "#a3adbd",
                    "fillOpacity": 1
                  }
                ],
                "fontFamily": "Arimo",
                "text": "A single effect has its own card, half a rack column: 164 px wide, so two singles and the cable between them span one 352 px rack card, and as tall as a rack card (360), so a mixed row lines up. No title: the pedal prints its name. Placement (Pre\/Post, where the destination has one) and power share the header line, the pedal fills the card, the assignment line sits at the bottom, level with a rack card's effect count. Engaged = accent surface, bypassed = plain card, as for racks."
              }
            ],
            "textTransform": "none",
            "textAlign": "left",
            "fontId": "custom-99a2c890-1804-450c-8af8-6b60ee9a6b27",
            "fontSize": "28",
            "fontWeight": "400",
            "textDirection": "ltr",
            "type": "paragraph",
            "fontVariantId": "normal-400",
            "textDecoration": "none",
            "letterSpacing": "0",
            "fills": [
              {
                "fillColor": "#a3adbd",
                "fillOpacity": 1
              }
            ],
            "fontFamily": "Arimo"
          },
          {
            "lineHeight": "1.4",
            "fontStyle": "normal",
