                "fills": [
                  {
                    "fillColor": "#a3adbd",
                    "fillOpacity": 1
                  }
                ],
                "fontFamily": "Arimo",
                "text": "Every card names the controls acting on it, as the assignment screens name them: Track 3, Track 3 \u00b7 Hold, CTRL 1, CTRL 1 \u00b7 Button 2, CC 20 \u00b7 Ch 1; the first and a count when several; Unassigned when none. A rack card's line sits above its effect count (the rack's own bindings and its effects'). The old A1 \u00b7 OFF style switch readouts became Track 1, A3 \u00b7 HELD Track 3 \u00b7 Hold, B1 CTRL 1 \u00b7 Button 2, B4 CTRL 2, Always on Unassigned."
              }
            ],
            "textTransform": "none",
            "textAlign": "left",
            "fontId": "custom-99a2c890-1804-450c-8af8-6b60ee9a6b27",
